<title>PHILIPPINES: JG Summit audited net 6.35 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>JG Summit audited net 6.35 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>	    (in billion pesos)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   1.43 vs   0.68</p>
<p>    Revenue			   18.37 vs  14.88</p>
<p>    Net profit			 6.35 vs   2.88</p>
<p>Note: JG Summit Holdings Inc has interests in food, banking, property development, cement and petrochemicals.</p>
<p>The firm's 1996 earnings included extraordinary gains. Without it, net income was 3.23 billion pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
